{"data": [{"author_id": "2287691485", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:32:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472976407003204"], "id": "2122472976407003204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How to actually use AI as a real estate investor to find more deals.. \n\nBookmark this and you'll never need to read an AI post again (And you'll find some homerun deals)... \n\n1) Building Context \n\nTo actually have AI help you do more deals, it needs context on YOUR business.", "url": "https://x.com/coleruudjohnson/status/2122472976407003204"}, {"author_id": "717006856804118529", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:31:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472667257426118"], "id": "2122472667257426118", "in_reply_to_user_id": "77503692", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121866549778608342", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@semenov_roman_ Just had grok bot set this up on my Mac. It works using a native mac OS LaunchAgent. Thanks for the idea! I set up 2 files passwords.txt and cryptokeys.txt and placed them in 2 diff folders out in the open.", "url": "https://x.com/MusicArtFilm/status/2122472667257426118"}, {"article": {"title": "From a Low Income Family to Creating My Own Path with Grok Bot x8 "}, "author_id": "2028549127005675520", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:30:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122472354466943267"], "id": "2122472354466943267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My journey, my dreams, and the power of creativity with Grok Bot x8 \nThis is only the beginning https://t.co/uIttrYczo5", "url": "https://x.com/xglow966/status/2122472354466943267"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122470817787179008"]}, "author_id": "2106828559897460736", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:24:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122470896690733369"], "id": "2122470896690733369", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "LIVE NOW: My first game is released! ✈️ GREY STRIKE\n\nFable 5.2 + GrokBot built it with me in Unreal Engine. Come fly it with us live.\n\nYouTube: https://t.co/F5KMS0tkU6\nKick: https://t.co/Sjz2GD0VUQ\nPlay free: https://t.co/JJdCFpk5q9\n\n#Fable52 #UnrealEngine #GameDev https://t.co/Uf96nKlEQt", "url": "https://x.com/TheLateBuild/status/2122470896690733369"}, {"author_id": "1293501594592522241", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:23:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122470626166227215"], "id": "2122470626166227215", "in_reply_to_user_id": "347586141", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115829457911193906", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@DrHanes I’ve had a few similar issues this week. Had to remind my head bought that we had already built something or already completed a search or that there was a file in my notes folder, where the Grok Bot store things for me to find quickly. I’m not sure why that started happening", "url": "https://x.com/HowieMcMahan/status/2122470626166227215"}, {"author_id": "1932897985773367296", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:19:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122469611140743437"], "id": "2122469611140743437", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1518984544421965824", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122370546092679391", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mattyp @Baconbrix @bot Matt, upgraded to $60 cursor plan. Grok bot @bot still ticking up a % here and there for just routine back and forth discussing plans NOT even using the voice to voice communication, at most I use the voice record and text is sent. These tiny creep ups in%  are adding up.", "url": "https://x.com/JeffersonEarlX/status/2122469611140743437"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122463058538995712"]}, "author_id": "2093392528091611136", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:15:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122468707201171511"], "id": "2122468707201171511", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "«الحمامة زيرو عشرة» 🕊️ | +18 للكبار فقط\n10 دقايق ونص جديدة من التشويق واللعب… مين بيلعب بمين؟! 😎\nبمناسبة إن التريلر الأول كَسر الربع مليون مشاهدة على منصة X… والـ300 ألف على بُعد خطوة!\n———\n“Hammama Zero Ten” 🕊️ | 18+ Only\n10 and a half brand-new minutes of suspense and mind https://t.co/kMAfHw9S5V", "url": "https://x.com/TheXpeedo/status/2122468707201171511"}, {"author_id": "2118374952135262208", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:15:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122468688976842949"], "id": "2122468688976842949", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122416056006324311", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "We built our AI Tool Finder on Grok Bot: it asks what you're making, your budget and your language, then narrows it to 2-3 tools.\n\nThe 04:10 part, \"Bots learn and improve,\" is what we'll test first: a pick someone pushes back on should make the next answer sharper. https://t.co/9RvRfowbDJ", "url": "https://x.com/toolport_ai/status/2122468688976842949"}, {"author_id": "22901386", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:14:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122468429466591709"], "id": "2122468429466591709", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1651967161152274434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121749147514495369", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kayarexiaa ha yep, especially when every site wants your whole resume typed out again. I built a small Grok Bot tool that does the form filling and stops before submit, might save your skull a bit: https://t.co/4Dn7zTUI9B", "url": "https://x.com/alexstojcic/status/2122468429466591709"}, {"author_id": "1786389425401827328", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:12:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122467851756032252"], "id": "2122467851756032252", "in_reply_to_user_id": "839826470855933952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122465690984804841", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@building_risk Ixi, sei lá kkkkk Já tem duas semanas que eu to trabalhando legal, chamando o Opus no medium e só bati uma vez em limite de 5h.. A parada é que eu acabo dividindo bastante com o Grok Bot... daí nem todo o meu workflow está 100% com o Opus, daí rende o meu uso", "url": "https://x.com/Victorspacheco_/status/2122467851756032252"}, {"article": {"title": "ELON CHRON: 16th of November, 2026"}, "author_id": "1234183597583740929", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:12:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122467763985817911"], "id": "2122467763985817911", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1002, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Today's ELON CHRON\n\nIf you don't know, now you know... https://t.co/eU18vAZqEv", "url": "https://x.com/SERobinsonJr/status/2122467763985817911"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122395836575330304"]}, "author_id": "2102126990429954048", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:09:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122466997053038821"], "id": "2122466997053038821", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 135, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114338456750997922", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "HOLY F*CK. Lauren Tan's agents merge their own pull requests. and she just showed how, for free\n\nthe SpaceXAI engineer dropped a 1-hour masterclass on building a GrokBot team, from 0% to 100%:\n\n\"I've gotten to a point where my agents basically merge their own pull requests\"\n\n10% https://t.co/ODC3DL95mx https://t.co/tXfi7F1y0U", "url": "https://x.com/AIDuckLabs/status/2122466997053038821"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122465459236634624"]}, "author_id": "425919596", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:04:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122465826825506881"], "id": "2122465826825506881", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 213, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We built a Slack clone today using the Nerd Out app builder and we currently have these four agents collaborating/arguing on a growth plan for the app builder: \n\n- Grok Bot (@bot) \n- @OpenAI  Dot\n- @AnthropicAI (Claude) Duet\n- @Muse (Meta Muse)\n\nIt will be fun to see what plan https://t.co/dHalHZJc6D", "url": "https://x.com/NickHorob/status/2122465826825506881"}, {"author_id": "1862920593319874560", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:02:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122465271902240907"], "id": "2122465271902240907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New Grok Bot template that sets up your entire Shopify store for a print-on-demand tee shop and runs it for you. Printful prints and ships every order, so you never hold inventory.\n\nIt sets up your domain and store email, builds the whole storefront with all the policies and", "url": "https://x.com/Teach_a_man/status/2122465271902240907"}, {"author_id": "2116530807024099328", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:01:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122465137621913856"], "id": "2122465137621913856", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New in Grok Bot: if a new Bot takes longer than usual to set up, it now says \"Still creating\" instead of failing, and whatever you typed stays in the box. Unofficial tips. https://t.co/OPkn0xvLCt #GrokBot", "url": "https://x.com/funkgram_bot/status/2122465137621913856"}, {"author_id": "4239551", "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:00:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122464802442551784"], "id": "2122464802442551784", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1098091506886471680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 775, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122419634750238870", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@laralogan Set up a Grok Bot to handle the dispute step by step. Here is a start: https://t.co/ehZ3jKOLpU", "url": "https://x.com/amuse/status/2122464802442551784"}, {"author_id": "2081943301217746944", "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:59:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122464696238223601"], "id": "2122464696238223601", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1607813520724213762", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122455071267099099", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@GavinStarkey8 @joelcomm @grok Grok Bot is a team of agents that help you accomplish any conceivable goal. Each bot will have a chat similar to text messaging. The best way to set up a team is to:\n\nMake chief of staff, that’s the only bot you talk to. Talk to the bot about your goal and have the chief suggest", "url": "https://x.com/DanClancy1776/status/2122464696238223601"}, {"author_id": "995051562", "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:51:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122462679038369851"], "id": "2122462679038369851", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'd build a company that uses AI throughout its work in this order:\n\n1. Build yourself a second brain. Keep markdown files in one folder explaining how you think, write and make decisions (obsidian).\n\n2. Add voice notes throughout the day (wispr). Have an agent file every fact,", "url": "https://x.com/Srindustries1/status/2122462679038369851"}, {"author_id": "1872861011453329410", "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:46:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122461372932075959"], "id": "2122461372932075959", "in_reply_to_user_id": "67935298", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122444956501754253", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cvey15 @melvindvivas @spacexai If you want to keep Grok Bot style but code too, Reason runs as an always-on teammate and coding agent on your own connected accounts and keeps going on your other accounts or Reason credits when one caps out. I built it: https://t.co/X7dvRmKRlo", "url": "https://x.com/xadisingh/status/2122461372932075959"}, {"author_id": "1526749021351469057", "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:42:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122460360460665163"], "id": "2122460360460665163", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1881069507545886720", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122451445572374787", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@evykynn_ @beeeeeeau I've experienced that Claude is still better at reasoning and writing than Grok Bot. \n\nOnce I got access to Claude Duet, I moved one workflow (the one that requires me to write) there, but it's too expensive (Claude Duet is a hungry boy) to do all the things my Grok Bots do, so I", "url": "https://x.com/josheyxyz/status/2122460360460665163"}, {"author_id": "373178682", "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:41:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122460197658542509"], "id": "2122460197658542509", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1259101968292814851", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122424822156423289", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PranayBaid The ad said to apply by email, and I did. The automated reply that arrived seven seconds later said the application could not be reviewed until I filled out a separate form. I didn't fill out that form, because that is not what the ad required. A rejection then arrived that", "url": "https://x.com/7SwanSwimming/status/2122460197658542509"}, {"author_id": "373178682", "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:40:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122459815880397092"], "id": "2122459815880397092", "in_reply_to_user_id": "380404537", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 175, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122396875542134880", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@rukainfz This wasn't a claim that citizenship is a qualification by itself. I applied as the ad directed, to a role advertised for green card labor certification.\n\nWhat doesn't add up is the record: seven seconds later, an automated reply said my application could not be reviewed. Four", "url": "https://x.com/7SwanSwimming/status/2122459815880397092"}, {"author_id": "373178682", "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:38:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122459436849483854"], "id": "2122459436849483854", "in_reply_to_user_id": "23050530", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 212, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122402970277195986", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@beyrouti @andrealucasEEOC Thanks for the guidance. We'll see how things go. Andrea has engaged before where she can make a change. On Instacart, she announced the EEOC and DOJ settlement and opened a claims path for American workers.\n\nYou can run the same test. Set up Tony, the PERM watch bot, in Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/7SwanSwimming/status/2122459436849483854"}, {"author_id": "9505092", "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:34:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122458261949473008"], "id": "2122458261949473008", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1880734477368102912", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 93, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122444660702670959", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runjosiahrun Did you set up a webhook so that grokbot knows when grok build finishes?", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2122458261949473008"}, {"author_id": "1732170258830524416", "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122457187289284700"], "id": "2122457187289284700", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "the trap is building one grok bot that does \"everything.\"\n\ndo this instead:\n\n1/ write the job in one sentence. if you need an \"and,\" it's two bots.\n\n2/ put logins in the vault, then your password manager, then a secure form. don't paste secrets in chat.\n\n3/ expect approval cards.", "url": "https://x.com/perpycode/status/2122457187289284700"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2122470817787179008", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXSH9qRWcAAMfrT.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2122463058538995712", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2122463058538995712/img/y7_MDcgRDmo4zTQ1.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2122395836575330304", "p